ESP32 / Embedded Edge Device Security Governance Lab
Copyright 2026 Jonne Silvennoinen

This repository is a public, synthetic governance and security-assurance lab for ESP32 and embedded edge-device projects.

The project includes firmware skeletons, documentation templates, Python validation models, evidence examples and workflow definitions intended for portfolio, learning, governance and defensive assurance use.

This repository does not contain customer-specific material, protected project records, classified information, production deployment data, credentials, keys, real network inventories or operational environment details.

MITRE EMB3D is referenced as an external framework for embedded-device threat-modeling alignment. This repository does not copy or redistribute the EMB3D dataset.

KATAKRI is referenced as a Finnish security-audit and public/private-boundary alignment context. This repository does not claim KATAKRI certification or authority approval.
